WEBVTT

00:00:00.790 --> 00:00:03.920
Oh, no... Please don't...
It's too much, don't look...

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:07.360
Get it? In other words, don't sit so close!

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:12.930
According to an old legend that
has circulated at our school for many years...

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:19.570
...if a boy on a school trip carries his beloved
like a princess beneath the blue sky at an inn,

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:23.160
and the innkeeper takes their picture, they will be together forever.

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:26.540
That's right! Your love will be fruitful.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:32.010
So, for the sake of Aoicchi's love for Hououin-kun,
let's try to make that legend come true...

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:34.450
...during the three days of our school trip!

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:35.830
Okay, Eri, Kurumi?

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:36.850
Okay!
Okay!

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:39.680
Hang on, Haruka! Don't go doing me
favors I never asked for!

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:42.010
The wheels are already in motion,
so you'd better enjoy the ride.

00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:42.890
It's your big chance!

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:46.280
It's like they say, seize the day
and jump from the Kiyomizu stage!

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:49.060
And here I'd decided to go it alone...

00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:52.820
Oh, well. How much harm
can a little help do?

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:57.590
Does it taste good?

00:00:58.470 --> 00:01:01.420
I have lots of mandarins here, Darling.

00:02:40.950 --> 00:02:45.200
Field Trip to the West...
The Fascinating Double Date!?

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:47.630
Kyoto... Kyoto...

00:02:47.630 --> 00:02:49.060
Wow, look at how golden it is!

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:49.560
It's beautiful!
Wow, look at how golden it is!

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:50.090
It's beautiful!

00:02:50.090 --> 00:02:51.480
What understated elegance!

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:52.510
Cool!

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:53.560
Motorikyuu Nijou Castle

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:54.240
No, it's Nijou-jou.

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:54.970
Note: a famous line from boxing anime "Ashita no Joe."
Motorikyuu Nijou Castle
No, it's Nijou-jou.

00:02:54.970 --> 00:02:55.940
Chouhou Temple
Rokkakudou
Skeleton (gaikotsu)!

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:56.530
No, you're thinking
of "kokkaku."

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:57.390
Chouhou Temple
Rokkakudou
No, you're thinking
of "kokkaku."

00:02:57.740 --> 00:03:01.060
Be sure to stay in your assigned groups during your free time this afternoon.

00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:03.540
Meet back at the Matsumura Inn at 6:00.

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:04.650
Yes, ma'am.

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:06.610
Hafun, hafuun...

00:03:06.610 --> 00:03:11.570
My first free time on my first field trip with my husband!

00:03:11.570 --> 00:03:12.460
Quit clinging to me!

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:15.110
Shouldn't a wife always
cling to her husband,

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:17.460
so that their hearts and minds
will become one?

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:18.870
What do you mean, "wife"?!

00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:19.510
Aw, you're so shy!
What do you mean, "wife"?!

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:20.120
Aw, you're so shy!

00:03:20.350 --> 00:03:22.560
They seem so happy together; I'm jealous...

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:24.490
Well, what a coincidence!

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:27.500
So you all are on the school trip as well?

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:28.500
Ryu... Ryu... Ryuu-

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:29.670
Nagisuke-kun!
Ryu... Ryu... Ryuu-

00:03:30.010 --> 00:03:31.300
What happened to <i>your</i>  group?

00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:34.920
Try all you want to monopolize
the attention of my precious maiden,

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:37.180
but you can never sever
the bonds between us.

00:03:37.180 --> 00:03:39.100
You... don't have any friends, do you?

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:40.230
H-How rude!

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:43.350
Forget about that! Ryuunosuke-kun, would you like to join us?

00:03:43.350 --> 00:03:45.720
See? Seimoto-san has invited me.

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:46.650
Whatever.

00:03:46.650 --> 00:03:48.440
Then it's a double date!

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:51.940
A "double date..."?
I like the sound of that!

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:54.970
Okay, let's follow the itinerary and go to Kiyomizu Temple.

00:03:54.970 --> 00:03:56.660
Okay!

00:03:56.660 --> 00:03:58.240
Don't order us around!

00:03:58.240 --> 00:04:00.830
I never thought my chance
would come so soon...!

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:03.710
Ryu... Ryuunosuke-kun...?

00:04:04.460 --> 00:04:09.710
The temperature today is 22C, with 15%
relative humidity and a NNE wind at 3 m/s.

00:04:09.710 --> 00:04:11.420
Oh, really?

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:13.290
Er... um...

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:14.260
Aoicchi!

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:18.400
What are you doing?! Switch to a better topic!

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:19.350
But...

00:04:19.350 --> 00:04:20.680
I guess we have no choice...

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:22.350
Ta-dah!

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:23.350
What's this?

00:04:23.350 --> 00:04:28.060
If Hououin-kun likes Rizel-chan,
then you'll have to be like her!

00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:30.650
We stayed up all night making it for you!

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:32.280
Everything begins with appearances.

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:35.610
However, we made the head disks
120% larger than Rizel's.

00:04:35.610 --> 00:04:40.210
Bigger is always better! With these,
Hououin-kun will be all over you!

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:40.700
What? But-

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:41.450
That's the way guys are!
What? But-

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:42.710
That's the way guys are!

00:04:42.710 --> 00:04:45.330
They like big breasts, butts,
and round head-disc things.

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:48.000
I'm a girl, and I feel
the same way about my Yuuya!

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:49.630
You mean Yuuya-kun is <i>that</i>  big?!

00:04:49.630 --> 00:04:50.500
What? What's big about him??

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:51.090
Come on, tell us, tell us!
What? What's big about him??

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:52.450
Come on, tell us, tell us!

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:54.090
How embarrassing...

00:04:54.510 --> 00:04:57.100
But if this is the first step in the whole
"princess carrying" thing...

00:04:57.100 --> 00:05:00.810
Yeah, I guess it's better
than doing nothing at all.

00:05:02.140 --> 00:05:02.760
Don't grab me so tightly!

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:03.890
Sorry to keep you waiting!
Don't grab me so tightly!

00:05:03.890 --> 00:05:04.460
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:05:06.510 --> 00:05:07.940
Ha-Hafuun...

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:10.650
Aoi-chan, you look so cute!!

00:05:10.650 --> 00:05:11.700
Hafuun!

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:12.700
We match!

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:14.830
But you're not the real thing; you'll have to wear yellow.

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:18.580
You mean the scarf tied in back, right?
But that's not the problem here!

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:21.530
M... m... my...

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:22.490
"My..."?

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:24.490
Say, "My husband, Hafuun!"

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:26.620
My... my good sir!

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:28.040
What century are we in again?!
What century are we in again?!

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:29.960
Ha... Hafu...

00:05:29.960 --> 00:05:32.540
Hafu... Ha...Hafuuuun!!

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:33.980
I did it!

00:05:36.420 --> 00:05:38.750
What's "Hafun" supposed to mean?

00:05:39.950 --> 00:05:41.140
That didn't work.

00:05:41.260 --> 00:05:44.820
I'm so embarrassed...
I wish a hole would open up and swallow me now.

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:46.490
Give me a break. Aren't you serious about this?

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:48.860
Just looking like her won't be good enough.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:50.730
But... you said "everything
begins with appearances"!

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:52.220
Quit making excuses!

00:05:52.220 --> 00:05:53.310
Ah, that's it! I've got another idea.

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:57.820
According to my sources,
Hououin-kun's tastes run in <i>this</i>  direction.

00:06:00.780 --> 00:06:02.590
You mean... I have to wear <i>those?!</i>

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:04.910
Who else do you think
is going to wear them?

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:06.380
But these...

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:09.560
Wear them, Aoi!
And then show them to Hououin-kun!

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:10.960
<i>SHOW</i>  HIM?!

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:12.900
What happens on vacation,
stays on vacation.

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:14.920
But it has a bear. A <i>bear!</i>

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:17.710
Never mind the bear!
Get over your shyness and go flash him!

00:06:21.390 --> 00:06:23.040
Well, I put them on...

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:24.670
Quit clinging to me already!

00:06:24.670 --> 00:06:26.080
Oh, you're such a shy boy!

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:28.120
<i>I'm</i>  not shy!

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:30.460
B-But... what next...?!

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:35.540
We've gone over the tactics.
Swish your own skirt around...

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:36.250
Or trip and fall down.

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:37.230
Do a handstand.
Or trip and fall down.

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:40.380
If it will win me Ryuunosuke-kun's heart...

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:47.530
No... I can't do it...

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:56.630
WOAAHHH!!!

00:06:57.130 --> 00:06:58.300
Just like mine!

00:06:58.300 --> 00:07:00.240
He ended up seeing them after all!

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:03.470
Seimoto-san, come with me.

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:07.840
I like this...

00:07:10.350 --> 00:07:14.440
Way to go, Aoi-chan!
This really is like a double date, Darling!

00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:16.440
Looks like that worked.

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:20.990
The Old City... It's so full of history...

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:23.670
...and I'm making history with my husband!

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:25.820
Seriously, stop suffocating me!

00:07:25.820 --> 00:07:27.320
Where'd those two go?

00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:30.750
Hafuun, my first time all alone with my Darling in Kyoto!

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:31.720
Hey!

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:36.710
Where is this, I don't even-

00:07:36.710 --> 00:07:40.630
This is a secret chamber of mine,
built for just such an occasion.

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:44.930
Forgive me for my sudden impropriety.

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:48.350
I simply <i>had</i>  to be alone with you.

00:07:48.350 --> 00:07:50.010
Ryuunosuke-kun...

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:56.650
I need a favor from you.

00:07:57.670 --> 00:08:00.910
I know it's selfish, and even absurd.

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:02.120
Ryuunosuke-kun?

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:06.620
But I cannot hold these feelings back any longer!
I want to see everything!

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:08.370
What do you mean, "everything"?

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:11.830
I have to see for myself...

00:08:12.330 --> 00:08:14.120
Take them off for me.

00:08:14.120 --> 00:08:16.000
R-Right away...!?

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:18.160
You have nothing to fear.

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:22.720
We haven't even taken the
princess-carrying photo yet...

00:08:23.170 --> 00:08:24.760
Come on...

00:08:25.950 --> 00:08:27.470
Ryuunosuke-kun...

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:31.680
Isn't it beautiful, Darling?

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:33.400
Yeah.

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:36.140
Don't stick to me!

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:40.070
Thank you for undressing for me.

00:08:40.070 --> 00:08:40.760
I'm so ashamed...

00:08:40.760 --> 00:08:41.250
You have nothing to be ashamed of!
I'm so ashamed...

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:42.690
You have nothing to be ashamed of!

00:08:42.690 --> 00:08:47.370
So beautiful... I'm going to take in
every last detail from front to back...

00:08:47.370 --> 00:08:49.620
Father, Mother, I'm so sorry!

00:08:49.620 --> 00:08:52.240
Your Aoi is about to lose
her most precious thing...

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:55.390
These aren't the ones?!

00:08:56.150 --> 00:09:00.010
I thought these were bear-print panties worn by the dancing girls of ancient Kyoto...

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:01.780
...but it's a faaaake!

00:09:02.530 --> 00:09:03.950
I'm very disappointed.

00:09:03.950 --> 00:09:06.630
Just think how lovely
my precious maiden would look

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:09.330
wearing the bear-print panties
of a maiko dancer...

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:11.390
See you later. My precious maiden
is waiting for me.

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:18.940
I went so far... I made up my mind
to "become an adult," and yet...!

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:20.900
Wait!

00:09:20.900 --> 00:09:24.480
Is Rizel-chan really so great?
Am I not good enough?

00:09:24.970 --> 00:09:28.570
I put on these clothes and head-discs,
and tried my best to act like Rizel-chan!

00:09:28.570 --> 00:09:32.080
After all I've done, why can't you look at me
the way you look at her?

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:35.970
I appreciate your feelings,
but you don't understand anything.

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:37.750
It's useless to merely
imitate her appearance.

00:09:38.440 --> 00:09:41.360
There is one critical difference
between you and my dear maiden.

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:44.840
You are not 12 years old.

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:49.690
That's right! I'm only interested
in 12-year-olds!

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:52.470
Why, you ask? 12-year-old girls are angelic!

00:09:52.930 --> 00:09:55.040
Not yet an adult, no longer a child...

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:58.320
The unstable unpredictability of 12-year-olds is what my dreams are made of!

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:01.370
My precious maiden, Rizel-san, is my angel!

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:02.400
But...

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:04.040
...but...

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:07.110
...even Rizel-chan will turn 13,
once her birthday comes around.

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:08.030
Huh?

00:10:08.030 --> 00:10:09.360
What do you mean, "huh"?

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:13.910
No! She will not age!

00:10:13.910 --> 00:10:16.490
Come on, Wakame-chan doesn't age, does she?

00:10:16.490 --> 00:10:19.030
She won't grow up! She <i>can't</i>  grow up!!

00:10:19.030 --> 00:10:22.080
My precious maiden is 12 years old <i>forever!</i>

00:10:23.650 --> 00:10:25.000
Ryuunosuke-kun!

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:27.240
Arrgh, my precious maiden!!

00:10:27.240 --> 00:10:29.600
Face up to reality, Ryuunosuke-kun!

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:31.870
My precious maiden will never age!!

00:10:31.870 --> 00:10:33.680
Real life isn't like anime!

00:10:33.680 --> 00:10:34.660
Yes it is!!

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:35.880
What're they up to?
Ryuunosuke-kun!

00:10:35.880 --> 00:10:37.870
Is it some new game? Let's play it too!

00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:38.600
Hell no!

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:40.770
Shizuka-chan doesn't get older, either!

00:10:40.770 --> 00:10:45.630
Even in anime, so-and-so Doremi
and Sailor what's-her-name got older!

00:10:45.630 --> 00:10:47.830
But Lum-san stays a 2nd-year
high school student!

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:50.690
Similarly, my precious maiden
will remain a 12-year-old forever!

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:53.490
If I say she's 12, she <i>is</i>  12!!

00:10:53.850 --> 00:10:55.910
An eternal 12-year-old...

00:10:55.910 --> 00:10:58.480
Wake up, Ryuunosuke-kun...

00:10:59.240 --> 00:11:01.460
Snap out of it!

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:07.220
Huh, he jumped.

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:09.590
Nice kick! It was so full of love!

00:11:09.590 --> 00:11:12.050
My first time being kicked into the sunset!

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:14.840
But now's not the time
for such observations!

00:11:20.540 --> 00:11:22.730
A beautiful boy has fallen from the sky!

00:11:22.730 --> 00:11:24.810
Okay, grin like a monkey!

00:11:24.810 --> 00:11:26.400
Ah! A photo...!

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:27.320
It was the head priest...

00:11:27.320 --> 00:11:28.200
...at a temple...

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:29.570
...so there's no problem.

00:11:29.570 --> 00:11:31.400
Way to be kicked, Sukesuke-kun!

00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:34.450
But don't forget to smile while you're airborne!

00:11:34.450 --> 00:11:36.850
Oh, and nice catch, mistress!

00:11:36.850 --> 00:11:38.710
Why are <i>you</i>  here?

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:41.210
I wanted to make lasting memories with you, Iwaki-kun.

00:11:41.210 --> 00:11:41.830
Now, look...

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:43.930
Shall we head back to the inn?

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:44.720
Hey!

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:46.120
Assembly time is 6:00 PM, right?

00:11:47.440 --> 00:11:49.300
So Kyouko actually showed up...

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:51.860
You told her our schedule, didn't you?!

00:11:51.860 --> 00:11:55.040
Rizel and Kyouko are both
beloved daughters to me...

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:57.510
I'm just a man who can't say no.

00:11:57.510 --> 00:11:59.100
There's trouble in the air.

00:12:03.730 --> 00:12:04.750
Hafun, hafuun...

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:06.140
Aoicchi!
Hafun, hafuun...

00:12:06.140 --> 00:12:07.730
Too bad, eh?

00:12:07.730 --> 00:12:11.420
Oh, come on. You were all just having fun at my expense.

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:14.920
We were doing it for your sake, Aoicchi!

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:16.570
Now she's sulking.

00:12:16.890 --> 00:12:19.200
Starting tomorrow, I'm going at it alone!

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:23.870
I <i>will</i>  make Ryuunosuke-kun come to his senses,
and make sure he senses <i>me!</i>

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:27.790
Darling, are you eating properly?

00:12:27.790 --> 00:12:30.840
Darling, can you pass me
the manly-scent shampoo?

00:12:30.840 --> 00:12:32.100
Darling!

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:33.730
She's calling for you, "Darling"!

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:34.930
Shut up.

00:12:36.570 --> 00:12:38.800
Thank you, Darling!

00:14:10.400 --> 00:14:13.640
Natsumi here! For the second day of the school trip, we're going to Nara.

00:14:13.640 --> 00:14:16.660
And now for a haiku based on the Matsutake mushroom, the dinner special at this inn:

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:19.630
Oh, Matsutake -
I really want to eat it.
I am so naughty.

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:23.830
Hmm, I want to take a big one in my mouth and savor it as I gulp it all down...

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:29.650
Natsumi here! For the second day of the field trip, we're going to Nara.

00:14:29.650 --> 00:14:33.090
And the specialty dish of this inn is none other than Matsutake!

00:14:33.090 --> 00:14:35.530
And now for a verse from back in Tokyo:

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:38.040
On long autumn nights
When one wants to act naughty
And be mischievous,

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:40.520
A banana is good,
but Matsutake is best.

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:43.640
Yeah, you sure can't have fall
without Matsutake.

00:14:43.640 --> 00:14:47.690
I want to take a big one in my mouth,
move it all around,

